      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Let $g,h$ and $k$ be integers. If $g∣h$ and $h∣k,$ then{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "For any integers $k,$ $m,$ and $n,$ we have that\n\n$$\ng∣h\\,\\text{and}\\,h∣k\\,⟹\\,g∣k.\n$$",
