      "problem": "Let $a,b,$ and $c$ be integers. If $a∣c,$ $b∣c,$ and $\\text{gcd}(a,b)=1$ then{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "For any integers $a,$ $b,$ and $c,$ we have that\n\n$$\na∣c,\\,b∣c,\\,\\text{and}\\,\\text{gcd}(a,b)=1\\,⟹\\,ab∣c.\n$$",
